  "title": "Unplanned downtime by plant, Q3 2026",
  "turns": [
    {
      "jobId": "7c8fb2a1-c4c3-4f1a-a5d5-ad2c25873c0b",
      "question": "Which plant had the most unplanned downtime hours in Q3 2026 (1 July to 30 September), and how many hours and unplanned events was that?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-03T04:15:17.533562Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-03T04:15:28.164439Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "**Dayton Plant (DAY)** had the most unplanned downtime in Q3 2026 (1 July–30 September), with **237.8 hours** across **12 unplanned events** [1].\n\n| Plant | Plant ID | Unplanned Events | Total Unplanned Downtime (hours) |\n|-------|----------|------------------|----------------------------------|\n| Dayton Plant | DAY | 12 | 237.8 |\n| Monterrey Plant | MTY | 8 | 185.2 |\n| Brno Plant | BRN | 5 | 113.5 |\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Structured retrieval result — manufacturing_operations — evidence `hermes-receipt:1de710e162ee4663c43c7129a789ba87d291474013397cf043fb0aae80a4d906`",
